        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Route from Manyata -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-24 bg-japandi-sand/30 border-y border-japandi-clay/30">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-japandi-moss">Quick Commute</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal">Quick 8-10 Minute Commute from Manyata</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          Skip the inner Bangalore traffic gridlock. House of Dental is located on Horamavu Agara Road right off Hennur Main Road, just a quick drive from Nagawara and Thanisandra Main Road.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-charcoal">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-japandi-moss mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>From Manyata Gate 1 &amp; 2:</strong> Head East onto Outer Ring Road towards Hennur junction, then turn into Horamavu Agara Road. (Approx. 8-10 minutes).</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-japandi-moss mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>From Thanisandra Main Road / Nagawara:</strong> Quick 10-minute drive via Hennur Bande. Dedicated parking available on site.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a 
            href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/dhU4UySs9WFkHAzYA" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-japandi-moss hover:text-japandi-charcoal transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Navigate via Google Maps</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-japandi-cream border border-japandi-clay/60 shadow-md space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Working Hours</h3>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs text-japandi-earth border-b border-japandi-clay/30 pb-4">
